---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Causes - Thamara Kandabada";
const slashpageImage = "/featured-images/causes.png";
---
<PageLayout title={pageTitle} image={slashpageImage}>
  <h1>Causes</h1>
  <p>Here are some of the causes I support in various capacities. If you are in a position to support any of these organisations, I encourage you to do so.</p>
  <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 01 Sep 2026</p>
  <h2>Regular financial donations</h2>
  <p>I support the following organisations with small financial donations every month.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong><a href="https://www.democracynow.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Democracy Now!</a>:</strong> Amy Goodman's progressive news program that covers stories often ignored by mainstream media.</li>
    <li><strong><a href="https://www.freecodecamp.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">freeCodeCamp</a>:</strong> A non-profit organization that provides free coding education and resources. I have benefitted from their free courses.</li>
    <li><strong><a href="https://opencollective.com/indieweb" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IndieWeb</a> via Open Collective:</strong> A community of independent and personal websites based on the principles of: owning your domain and using it as your primary online identity, publishing on your own site first (optionally elsewhere), and owning your content. See my <a href="/indieweb">/IndieWeb</a> page for more information.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Volunteer work</h2>
  <p>I occasionally volunteer my time and skills to support:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong><a href="https://www.theturnaroundproject.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Turnaround Project</a>:</strong> A non-profit organization that provides support and employment opportunities for individuals who have been through the criminal justice system. I have designed <a href="/design/categories/charity-events">posters</a> for and helped out at their events.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Past support</h2>
  <p>I have previously donated to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong><a href="https://www.npr.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">NPR</a>:</strong> A public radio network that provides news and cultural programming. My regular donations ended only because I had to trim down my list due to financial constraints.</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>